          "ipa": "ɛ",
          "context": "followed by y in another syllable",
          "example": "odeya [oˈdɛjɑ] room"
        },
        {
          "ipa": "ɛ",
          "context": "after the stress, particularly word-finally",
          "example": "miróvek [mɪˈrovɛk] a man"
        }
      ],
      "note": "Thackston takes [æ] as the reference pronunciation; many speakers are closer to [ɛ].",
      "hint": {
        "status": "proposed",
